    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/136230bebeac6ab5b451a3ac7e3c922e.avif?t=1739719736\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel alone or with friends through the land of Cretacia</strong> - a land of war, banditry and dinosaurs. Each mission is a short, self-contained journey with its own enemies, ability combinations, loot and objectives. Your friend can't make it tonight? They can join you on the next mission tomorrow without getting left behind. Or you can strike out on your own. We get it, not everybody wants to share the power and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/485fa1648cf8c8d57906adb02855328f.poster.avif?t=1739719736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/485fa1648cf8c8d57906adb02855328f.webm?t=1739719736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/485fa1648cf8c8d57906adb02855328f.mp4?t=1739719736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every mission is different and not every journey ends in victory. You'll recruit new characters with each outing, so even defeat has its upside. What are you waiting for? Cretacia isn't going to save itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/6d0bc87b7bc12160e168e74149650be7.poster.avif?t=1739719736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/6d0bc87b7bc12160e168e74149650be7.webm?t=1739719736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/6d0bc87b7bc12160e168e74149650be7.mp4?t=1739719736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/136230bebeac6ab5b451a3ac7e3c922e.avif?t=1739719736\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel alone or with friends through the land of Cretacia</strong> - a land of war, banditry and dinosaurs. Each mission is a short, self-contained journey with its own enemies, ability combinations, loot and objectives. Your friend can't make it tonight? They can join you on the next mission tomorrow without getting left behind. Or you can strike out on your own. We get it, not everybody wants to share the power and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/485fa1648cf8c8d57906adb02855328f.poster.avif?t=1739719736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/485fa1648cf8c8d57906adb02855328f.webm?t=1739719736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/485fa1648cf8c8d57906adb02855328f.mp4?t=1739719736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every mission is different and not every journey ends in victory. You'll recruit new characters with each outing, so even defeat has its upside. What are you waiting for? Cretacia isn't going to save itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/6d0bc87b7bc12160e168e74149650be7.poster.avif?t=1739719736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/6d0bc87b7bc12160e168e74149650be7.webm?t=1739719736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064310/extras/6d0bc87b7bc12160e168e74149650be7.mp4?t=1739719736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
